T153 OpenWrt port licensing

Individual source files retain their SPDX identifiers and upstream copyright
notices. Newly authored build and validation scripts are GPL-2.0-only unless
otherwise noted. Device tree files retain their dual GPL/MIT terms.
Full license texts are in LICENSES/. Source provenance is in docs/SOURCES.txt.
The source overlay archive does not contain the Tina SDK or boot/DDR blobs.

The persistent source SPL/DDR/U-Boot firmware does not link vendor DDR blobs.
The optional temporary FES RAM loader is different: its user-supplied factory
FES1/DDR and vendor U-Boot payloads are external binary inputs, currently marked
LicenseRef-NOASSERTION. They are not included in this source repository/archive.
The software-20261104 Release separately provides the specified 933 MHz RAM
loader binary and its provenance manifest. This does not change its vendor
license or make the FES implementation open source. The Git source repository
contains extraction/packaging code, fixed hashes and non-executable container
metadata; see docs/FES-REPRODUCE.txt and configs/fes-stock-loader.json.
